<title>YUGOSLAVIA: SOCCER-RED STAR BELGRADE WIN YUGOSLAV CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RED STAR BELGRADE WIN YUGOSLAV CUP.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red Star Belgrade beat Vojvodina</p>
<p>Novi Sad 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in the second leg of the Yugoslav</p>
<p>Cup final on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Zoran Njegus 84 pen.</p>
<p>Red Star win 1-0 on aggregate.</p>
</text>
